{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13588","headline":"赠李十二白 · 崔宗之","name":"赠李十二白","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉风八九月，白露满空庭。\n耿耿意不畅，捎捎风叶声。\n思见雄俊士，共话今古情。\n李侯忽来仪，把袂苦不早。\n清论既抵掌，玄谈又绝倒。\n分明楚汉事，历历王霸道。\n担囊无俗物，访古千里余。\n袖有匕首劒，怀中茂陵书。\n双眸光照人，词赋凌子虚。\n酌酒弦素秦，霜气正凝洁。\n平生心中事，今日爲君说。\n我家有别业，寄在嵩之阳。\n明月出高岑，清谿澄素光。\n云散窗户静，风吹松桂香。\n子若同斯游千载不相忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔宗之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}